        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1500">

                <pb facs="1212" n="1096" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1096"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/376.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose herewith for your information a
                    copy of a joint letter of Messrs. Brown Brothers and Company and Messrs. J. and
                    W. Seligman and Company, transmitting correspondence with Messrs. F. C. Harrison
                    and Charles A. Conant, in regard to a proposed loan to Nicaragua by the Brown
                    and Seligman companies, and the railway and canal projects which are being
                    considered in connection therewith.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1500-a1.xml" xpointer="d1500-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
